{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 303,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER303.YBC",
      "sha256": "468edf3a14d9c0b5f222bcfe397d6031b7bf6285e18b4cee68896734da6e1a4e",
      "text_count": 60,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "老老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 240,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "……薛莉爾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 284,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3,
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "對「匍伏蔓延而來之物」來說，\n「因緣」究竟是什麼呢……？\n芭特菈閣下的話，究竟是什麼意思……？\n她為什麼對赤壁鄔爾戈的事情這麼熟悉……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 310,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 336,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "……抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 374,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            8,
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "究竟她為什麼會知道這些事情我也不明白。\n但是妳覺得天秤之長所說的話，\n會是幫助還是陷害呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 400,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 426,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "無論是誰，也會多少出一點力幫忙的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 452,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "……老老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 496,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15,
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "說不定就是因為她曾經被囚禁在那黑闇的鎖鏈\n裡，所以才能夠發現這些事情吧。\n仔細想想，\n說不定她也正在思念那被囚禁起來的人呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 522,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "您是說被賢者的圓桌給囚禁的奈比洛斯閣下？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 548,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "是的，而且芭特菈一定也很想把她救出來吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 574,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "可是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 606,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "再想想看……\n她又是為什麼會被引來艾爾貝洛瓦呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 628,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 662,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25,
            26
          ],
          "text": "她的雙眼─\n最後還是看穿了那應該無法穿透的白皙城砦，\n在其中穿梭。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 692,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            27,
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "她的雙眼─\n是因為忍受著無法言喻的痛苦，\n才能見到那不為人知的景象。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 718,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 750,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32
          ],
          "text": "那到底是謊話還是實話呢？\n是為了她的慾望，還是為了她的思念？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 776,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 820,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35,
            36,
            37
          ],
          "text": "總有一天，我們會知道的。\n在那一天到來的時候，\n無論是我還是妳，\n應該都可以釐清所有的疑點了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 846,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 884,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40,
            41
          ],
          "text": "其實呀，我是這麼認為的……\n在這個世界上，\n也許向別人發問是沒辦法讓自己感到安寧的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 910,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "老老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 960,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            43,
            44,
            45,
            46,
            47
          ],
          "text": "因為那會讓自己不能好好地思索，\n讓那澄澈的眼睛受到矇蔽。\n妳呀，只要好好地去相信她就好了。\n妳對她的信任，\n將會給予她不小的支持。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 986,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 1012,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "妳能做到吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 1044,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51
          ],
          "text": "……是的。\n我可以為此發誓。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 1076,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            52,
            53
          ],
          "text": "真是個好孩子。\n那就趕快回去吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 1102,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "……晚安。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 1204,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            55,
            56,
            57
          ],
          "text": "…………\n純潔之盾之長呀……\n懇請您拯救愛爾梅納斯吧……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 303,
          "source_offset": 1228,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "……並且也懇請您，\n將充滿了這個世界的混沌一起全部消除……"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 1260,
          "opcode": 15,
          "string_index": 1,
          "target": "data/adv/dat/Chapter218.ybc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 218,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER218.YBC",
      "sha256": "abfd792da93faebf1a55cf100ab3fcbc571cf1b486025fd4c732ab20e3f9961c",
      "text_count": 25,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 98,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 136,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "瑟希莉絲。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 162,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "那個……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 188,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 226,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "聽說達雷希昂砦……\n被「匍伏蔓延而來之物」給佔領了……\n這是真的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 258,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "沒錯。\n鎖匙之長已經親眼確認過這件事情了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 284,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 310,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "我們會收復它的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 336,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "咦……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 362,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "……如果我這麼說的話，妳的想法如何呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 388,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "……我，我啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 414,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 446,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "因為那是……\n老師第一次教導我如何戰鬥的地方……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 472,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 504,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19
          ],
          "text": "所以如果可以的話，我也希望收復那裡。\n因為那裡是充滿我回憶的地方……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 530,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "……嗯嗯，的確是這樣呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 556,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "……老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 588,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "那就請妳等一下到職務室來做簡報，\n沒問題吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 218,
          "source_offset": 614,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "是的……！"
        }
      ],
